---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Sidebar from "../components/Sidebar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy | Jeff Rescignano" description="What this website collects and how it handles analytics.">
  <div class="content">
    <Sidebar />
    <main class="main" id="main">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Privacy</h1>

        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          This site uses <a href="https://posthog.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PostHog</a> for
          analytics. PostHog receives the events listed below from your browser.
        </p>

        <h2>What is collected</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Page views.</li>
          <li>Automatic click events (PostHog autocapture).</li>
          <li>Unhandled JavaScript errors and unhandled promise rejections.</li>
          <li>
            Custom events when you open a blog article, a recommended article, the RSS feed, a project repository, an
            external profile link, or a certification verification link, and when you toggle the mobile navigation.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Cookies and storage</h2>
        <p>
          PostHog is set to keep its data in memory only. It does not set cookies and does not write to localStorage or
          sessionStorage. Each page load is treated as a new, anonymous visitor.
        </p>

        <h2>Global Privacy Control</h2>
        <p>
          If your browser sends the Global Privacy Control signal or Do Not Track, PostHog is not loaded and no
          analytics events are sent.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Contact me through <a href="https://github.com/JeffResc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <Footer />
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  h2 {
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
</style>
